text = "[color=#00e5ff][b]MOVEMENT:[/b][/color] Use [b]W, A, S, D[/b] or [b]Arrow Keys[/b] to move Ellis Parker.
[color=#00e5ff][b]FLASHLIGHT:[/b][/color] Automatically aims toward your current walking direction.
[color=#00e5ff][b]INTERACT:[/b][/color] Walk up to lab fixtures (Terminal, Whiteboard, Oscilloscope) and press [b]E[/b] to inspect.
[color=#00e5ff][b]SECURITY OVERRIDE PUZZLE:[/b][/color]
Each clue gives parts of the 4-digit code.
Inspect all 3 fixtures, then use the Keypad beside the blast door to enter the code and unlock Sector A!"

